    {
      "text": "Do you prefer to study in the mornings or in the afternoons?",
      "speaker": "a",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.82
    },
    {
      "text": "Basically, I like studying in the mornings — but here's the funny part: I don't get up in the mornings. I often wake up too late, like 9 a.m. or even 11 a.m., so I usually sleep through the morning and study in the afternoon. But in theory, I prefer mornings, because they're much quieter than afternoons. A quiet space and waking up early to study gives me this sense that I'm a better person, that I have better execution ability, you know.",
      "speaker": "b",
      "start": 3.31,
      "end": 27.32
    }
